// Real translations for dashboard UI text - a single, growable
// dictionary shared by every page (not one file per page), keyed by the
// literal English string. Falls back to that English string itself for
// anything not yet translated, so a partially-translated dashboard never
// shows a blank or a raw key - just English, exactly like today, until
// that specific string's module gets done. Built up incrementally,
// module by module, rather than attempting the whole dashboard - a
// direct correction of it not existing on the last pass.
